  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Unaccompanied Migrant Children at the Greek Borders through Shelter (MERIMNA II - Shelter)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to ensure the continuous operation of Safe Areas in the Greek islands, providing unnacompanied migrant children (UMC) with safe shelter and child-appropriate support. The project will contribute to national efforts to improve the well-being and access to fundamental rights of UMC arriving to the Greek islands, by ensuring that UMC living in the Safe Areas have access to immediate assistance in line with their best interest. The project is complemented by the project &apos;Merimna II- Protection&apos;, which includes child protection activities in the context of the Safe Areas</narrative>
  </description>
